OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to make loos more
OL,4,Astoma-friendly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has set up a support group
OL,7,Ffor people with stomas is starting a
OL,8,Fnew campaign to make public loos more
OL,9,Faccessible.
OL,11,FOne in 335 people in the UK are
OL,12,Fcurrently living with a stoma, an
OL,13,Fopening on the surface of the abdomen
OL,14,Fwhich has been surgically created to
OL,15,Fdivert the flow of faeces or urine into
OL,16,Fa detachable bag, according to
OL,17,FColostomy UK.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
