OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to make loos more
OL,4,Astoma-friendly
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaula Butler had stoma surgery in 2023,
OL,7,Fhaving lived with a bowel condition 10
OL,8,Fyears ago. She said she wanted to make
OL,9,Fgoing out and about easier and less
OL,10,Fdaunting.
OL,12,FThe campaign is calling for all
OL,13,Faccessible toilets to have a shelf,
OL,14,Fhooks on the back of the door, a full
OL,15,Flength mirror, and a bin.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
